"""
CAISO Daily Fuel Mix Report — fully automated, no Excel required.

Pipeline:
  1. Download yesterday's fuelsource.csv from CAISO (same download logic /
     proxy handling as the original automation2.2.py).
  2. Compute start-of-day / end-of-day / daily-average / net-change stats
     per fuel type with pandas.
  3. Render a single-page portrait dashboard (3 pies, 2 bar charts, 1 line
     chart, all data-labeled) with matplotlib.
  4. Save the dashboard as a PDF (and a PNG) to the OneDrive-synced folder.

Power Automate's only remaining job: watch ONE_DRIVE_PATH for the constant
filename below and email it — no chart-building in Power Automate at all.

Placeholders to change are marked ">>> CHANGE_ME <<<".
"""

